[[64,127,0,"<p>Carry out op. \n                                       <a href=\"#/3237699\">1072C44</a>\n                                       .</p><p>Fit the tool fitted with the dial gauge\nto the actuator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.098.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect an air line and pressure gauge to\nthe actuator.</p><p>Introduce air at a pressure of 0.86 - 0.91\nbar and check that the travel on the dial gauge corresponds to the\nrecommended value.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Stroke (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>air to (bar)</p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p>0.86 - 0.91</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019894.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]